sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Server as studies.cs.helsinki.fi

    User->>Browser: Write a note and click Save
    Note right of Browser: JavaScript handles form submission<br/>and prevents the default page reload
    Browser->>Browser: Create note with content and date
    Browser->>Browser: Add note to local list and clear text field
    Browser->>Browser: Redraw notes to display the new note
    Browser->>Server: POST /exampleapp/new_note_spa<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>{"content": "New note", "date": "..."}
    Server->>Server: Store the new note
    Server-->>Browser: 201 Created<br/>{"message": "note created"}
    Note over Browser,Server: No redirect or page reload